  "AE 3530": {"name": "System Dynamics and Vibration", "hours": 3, "description": "Modeling and analysis of lumped- and distributed-parameter systems, free and forced vibration in mechanical systems, free vibration in structural systems. Students cannot receive credit for both AE 3530 and ME 3017 or AE 3530 and AE 3515."},
